<runspec version="MOVES6.0.0">
  <description><![CDATA[movesr DMV golden set (start and evaporative, off-network). MOVES6.0.0 defaults, calendar 2025, July weekday hours 16-17, District of Columbia, Montgomery County MD and Fairfax County VA (default weather, fuels and I/M). All 13 source types and valid fuels; running, start, brake, tire and evaporative processes; THC, CO, NOx, CH4, N2O, NH3, SO2, CO2, CO2e, energy, NMHC, NMOG, TOG, VOC and PM species. Urban unrestricted road.]]></description>
